From f7432fbb99aac22ef3d6f931869bc1515fe82347 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: erranter <erranter@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:39:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] feat(chatgpt-browser): show or reload a thread's ChatGPT
 tab

The thread action menu now offers Show ChatGPT tab and Reload ChatGPT tab for ChatGPT Browser threads. The server resolves the thread's active provider session, the host resolves the conversation from that session's live operation, and the extension either focuses the tab (reveal, existing path) or force-reloads it with bypassCache. A session with no open tab fails explicitly instead of opening an unrelated conversation.
